  "name": "Infectious Charms (Su)",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "subType": "classFeat",
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Illusionist 9</p><p>Anytime the illusionist targets and successfully affects a single creature with a charm or compulsion spell and that creature is within 30 feet of another opponent, his spell has a chance of affecting the second creature as well. As a swift action immediately after affecting a creature with a charm or compulsion spell, he can cause the spell to carry over to the nearest creature within 30 feet. The spell behaves in all ways as though its new target were the original target of the spell.</p>",
